---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PolicyContact from "../../components/PolicyContact.astro";
import { brand } from "../../../brand.config";
---

<BaseLayout title="Refund Policy">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <div class="page-shell__inner">
      <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
      <p>
        {brand.name} is a children's watch manufacturer supplying B2B wholesale,
        ready-stock, and custom OEM/ODM orders. Policies differ by order type —
        please review your order details carefully before confirming payment.
      </p>

      <div class="policy-note">
        <strong>Important</strong>
        <ul>
          <li>
            OEM/ODM orders: once watch production has started, refunds are not
            available.
          </li>
          <li>
            Ready-stock orders: once goods have been shipped, returns and refunds
            are not available.
          </li>
        </ul>
        We do not offer unconditional returns. Please consider your order carefully
        before checkout.
      </div>

      <hr />

      <h2>OEM/ODM (custom) orders</h2>
      <p>
        Custom children's watches are produced or branded to your specifications —
        model, dial, strap, packaging, logo, or other requirements. These items are
        made specifically for you and cannot be resold as standard stock. Once
        production has started, the order cannot be cancelled and refunds are not
        available, even if goods have not yet shipped.
      </p>

      <h2>Ready-stock (in-stock) orders</h2>
      <p>
        Ready-stock watches are standard models shipped from existing inventory. For
        these orders, returns and refunds are not available once goods have been
        dispatched. Please confirm model numbers, quantities, and shipping details
        before we ship.
      </p>

      <h2>Before you place an order</h2>
      <p>To avoid misunderstandings, we recommend that you:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Confirm model numbers, quantities, colors, and customization details in
          writing before production or shipment.
        </li>
        <li>Review samples or reference images when available.</li>
        <li>
          Ask questions about MOQ, lead time, packaging, and shipping before payment.
        </li>
        <li>
          Ensure your shipping address and import requirements are correct.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        For OEM/ODM orders, terms are final once production begins. For ready-stock
        orders, terms are final once goods are shipped — except for verified
        factory-quality issues described below.
      </p>

      <h2>Damages and quality issues</h2>
      <p>
        Please inspect your shipment as soon as it arrives. If you believe items
        have a confirmed factory defect — such as the wrong model, a major
        functional fault not caused in transit, or significant damage attributable
        to our packing — contact us immediately with photos, video, and your order
        reference. Claims must be submitted within 7 days of delivery.
      </p>

      <h2>How to report an issue</h2>
      <p>
        Contact our team by email or WhatsApp with your order number, a clear
        description of the issue, and supporting photos or video. Do not return goods without our
        prior written approval and return instructions. Unauthorized returns may be
        refused.
      </p>

      <h2>Exceptions / non-returnable cases</h2>
      <p>The following are generally not eligible for return or refund:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>OEM/ODM orders once production has started.</li>
        <li>Ready-stock orders once goods have been shipped.</li>
        <li>
          Change of mind, buyer's remorse, or orders placed with incorrect
          specifications confirmed by the buyer.
        </li>
        <li>
          Cosmetic variations within normal factory tolerance agreed before
          production.
        </li>
        <li>
          Damage after delivery, improper storage, handling, or modification by the
          buyer or end customer.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>Final terms for your order are confirmed before production or dispatch.</p>

      <h2>Cancellations</h2>
      <p>
        If you need to cancel or change an order, contact us as early as possible.
        For OEM/ODM orders, cancellations may be considered only before production
        starts and are subject to any costs already incurred (materials, tooling,
        labor, or deposits). For ready-stock orders, cancellations may be
        considered only before shipment. Once production has started or goods have
        been shipped, cancellation and return are not available.
      </p>

      <h2>Resolution for approved claims</h2>
      <p>
        If we verify a qualifying factory defect, we may offer replacement units,
        repair where practical, or credit against a future order. Partial refunds
        may apply only when agreed in writing. We do not provide retail-style
        refunds for bulk wholesale orders except in exceptional cases confirmed by
        both parties.
      </p>

      <h2>Refunds</h2>
      <p>
        When a refund is approved, we will notify you and process it to your
        original payment method where applicable. Processing typically takes up to
        10 business days after approval, plus any additional time required by your
        bank or payment provider. If more than 15 business days have passed since
        approval, please contact us.
      </p>

      <h2>European Union customers</h2>
      <p>
        Where applicable law provides a statutory withdrawal period, please note
        that custom-made or personalized goods produced to your specifications are
        typically exempt from unconditional return rights. By confirming a custom or
        wholesale order, you acknowledge that production follows your approved
        specifications and that refunds are not available once production starts
        (OEM/ODM) or once goods are shipped (ready-stock), except for verified
        factory defects.
      </p>

      <PolicyContact />

      <p class="policy-related">
        Related: <a href="/policies/shipping-tax">Shipping &amp; tax</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
